{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817240/extras/f77f88e4a940c304343d9399b32a381a.poster.avif?t=1757699608\" width=742 height=418 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817240/extras/f77f88e4a940c304343d9399b32a381a.webm?t=1757699608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817240/extras/f77f88e4a940c304343d9399b32a381a.mp4?t=1757699608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>A young man, Selim Kara, is found dead under mysterious circumstances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His computer, encrypted and corrupted after a camera is plugged in, hides something beyond explanation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are  an agent working for the National Intelligence Center.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your task: decrypt the files. And don\u2019t look too deep.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcbe WELCOME BACK TO 2005... BUT DIFFERENT.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817240/extras/8fa25dcd144f78eda2beebb8f4a843aa.poster.avif?t=1757699608\" width=800 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817240/extras/8fa25dcd144f78eda2beebb8f4a843aa.webm?t=1757699608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817240/extras/8fa25dcd144f78eda2beebb8f4a843aa.mp4?t=1757699608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boot into a hauntingly familiar desktop.<br> From chunky icons to broken files and eerie startup sounds... The game recreates a fictional 2005 where the internet feels analog, and every click echoes through time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s nostalgic. But something\u2019s off.<br> This isn't the 2005 you remember.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f THEY ARE PRETENDING TO BE A HUMAN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817240/extras/1bd59b2a858d2e462645d53ca935fe9a.poster.avif?t=1757699608\" width=580 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817240/extras/1bd59b2a858d2e462645d53ca935fe9a.webm?t=1757699608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817240/extras/1bd59b2a858d2e462645d53ca935fe9a.mp4?t=1757699608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you dig deeper, you begin to question what's real and w\u0336\u0315\u034a\u0350\u030a\u0308\u0315\u0360\u030c\u0312\u0311\u0315\u031ch\u0335\u0360\u0314\u030f\u030b\u030f\u034a\u034a\u0333\u034d\u0330\u0347\u0329\u0321\u033c\u034d\u031c\u0332\u031c\u0327a\u0334\u0305\u035d\u035d\u030c\u0344\u0310\u0309\u030b\u030e\u0322\u0355\u0324\u0324\u034d\u035a\u0327\u0324\u035a\u0354\u0317t\u0338\u0300\u0333\u031e\u032c\u0354\u0356\u0326\u0320 \u0334\u0351\u0301\u0308\u0310\u0304\u034b\u031a\u0357\u030a\u0309\u035d\u0358\u030b\u0312\u034e\u0330\u0359\u0354\u0328\u031e\u032b\u033a\u0325\u0320i\u0338\u0357\u030b\u0360\u0301\u0310\u0302\u0302\u0341\u0310\u0309\u032a\u0347\u0321\u0353s\u0337\u033f\u0311\u0314\u030e\u0311\u0360\u0339\u0353\u031d\u0347\u032f\u033a\u034e\u0345\u0329 \u0335\u033f\u0312\u0340\u0332\u0347n\u0336\u030e\u0308\u0308\u0343\u030e\u0304\u0352\u0312\u031d\u0349\u0354\u0331\u0356\u0329\u0328\u034e\u033b\u032e\u0326\u033b\u035c\u034e\u032do\u0337\u033d\u0300\u0346\u0308\u033e\u030e\u0332\u0332\u0331\u0320\u0319t\u0336\u0340\u034b\u0301\u0343\u0315\u0306\u030b\u0301\u030c\u031d.\u0335\u0314\u0312\u0357\u0303\u0303\u0301\u0308\u031e\u0317\u0330\u032d\u0324\u0332\u0329\u0349\u0321\u0354\u0330\u0323\u033b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange behaviors. Files that write themselves.<br> Something is lurking inside, born not from code, but from <strong><i>memory</i></strong>. Not created by humans, and not meant to be seen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It learns. It listens. And it doesn\u2019t want to be found.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\uddec TURQUOISE TECHNOLOGIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817240/extras/534d18c8722dccd7bcafc114eeba8b9a.poster.avif?t=1757699608\" width=800 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817240/extras/534d18c8722dccd7bcafc114eeba8b9a.webm?t=1757699608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817240/extras/534d18c8722dccd7bcafc114eeba8b9a.mp4?t=1757699608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turqoise Company was once a rising star in the global tech industry, famous for its AI breakthroughs and ambitious vision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But behind closed doors, a classified program known as the <strong><i>Heaven Project</i></strong> was launched.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sounds good, right? Then experience heaven firsthand in this game and see this terrible madness created by turquoise</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcfc STEP INTO THE VIDEOS - <i>Face fears that aren't yours</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817240/extras/cfa20e298c4d1ab754398e125bf71cf6.poster.avif?t=1757699608\" width=800 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817240/extras/cfa20e298c4d1ab754398e125bf71cf6.webm?t=1757699608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817240/extras/cfa20e298c4d1ab754398e125bf71cf6.mp4?t=1757699608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Selim Kara\u2019s final memories aren\u2019t just recorded, they\u2019re <strong>playable</strong>.<br> Each decrypted video becomes a first-person journey through his simulated <strong>heaven</strong>. <br> which quickly twists into something much darker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk through memory-made landscapes. <strong>Face fears that aren't yours</strong>.<br> And find out what truly went wrong in the <strong>Heaven Project.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f NOSTALGIA AS YOU WANT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817240/extras/fd10bf6dbf73d9e6ae9069a499b54609.poster.avif?t=1757699608\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817240/extras/fd10bf6dbf73d9e6ae9069a499b54609.webm?t=1757699608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817240/extras/fd10bf6dbf73d9e6ae9069a499b54609.mp4?t=1757699608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We didn\u2019t just simulate the past, we <i>rebuilt</i> it.<br> From early 2000s internet slang and web design to the sounds of CRT monitors and classic error tones, everything is lovingly crafted to capture a time that's gone... but not forgotten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not retro for the sake of style.<br> It's memory turned into atmosphere.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd27 FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udda5\ufe0f A fully interactive retro desktop interface (inspired by Windows 95 &amp; 98)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc2 No HUD, no tutorials, just you, your instincts, and the machine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcfc Six <strong>playable memory-videos</strong>, each unlocking deeper psychological layers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf10 Nostalgic 2000s internet: from forums to fake websites, reimagined with eerie accuracy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Psychological and analog horror drawn from generative AI anomalies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd70\ufe0f Carefully crafted <strong>nostalgic atmosphere</strong>,\u00a0not just visual, but emotional</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3817240?t=1757699608","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817240/a96d44273338f31cf4c9c404ec24f34977c6929c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757699608","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817240/284a8b85f16d91b303bb9d798553884fe3cde697/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757699608","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817240/284a8b85f16d91b303bb9d798553884fe3cde697/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757699608","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Mature Content Description:\r\n\r\nThis game contains psychological horror elements, unsettling imagery, themes of death and digital consciousness, and moments of intense existential dread.\r\nThere is no sexual content or depictions of explicit violence. However, the narrative may include references to self-termination, loss of agency, artificial control over human memories, and fragmented identity.\r\nPlayers sensitive to themes of isolation, mental breakdown, or corrupted spiritual imagery may find certain sequences disturbing.\r\n\r\nViewer discretion is advised."},"demos":[{"appid":4005920,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817240/extras/f77f88e4a940c304343d9399b32a381a.poster.avif?t=1757699608\" width=742 height=418 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817240/extras/f77f88e4a940c304343d9399b32a381a.webm?t=1757699608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817240/extras/f77f88e4a940c304343d9399b32a381a.mp4?t=1757699608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>A young man, Selim Kara, is found dead under mysterious circumstances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His computer, encrypted and corrupted after a camera is plugged in, hides something beyond explanation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are  an agent working for the National Intelligence Center.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your task: decrypt the files. And don\u2019t look too deep.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcbe WELCOME BACK TO 2005... BUT DIFFERENT.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817240/extras/8fa25dcd144f78eda2beebb8f4a843aa.poster.avif?t=1757699608\" width=800 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817240/extras/8fa25dcd144f78eda2beebb8f4a843aa.webm?t=1757699608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817240/extras/8fa25dcd144f78eda2beebb8f4a843aa.mp4?t=1757699608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boot into a hauntingly familiar desktop.<br> From chunky icons to broken files and eerie startup sounds... The game recreates a fictional 2005 where the internet feels analog, and every click echoes through time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s nostalgic. But something\u2019s off.<br> This isn't the 2005 you remember.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f THEY ARE PRETENDING TO BE A HUMAN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817240/extras/1bd59b2a858d2e462645d53ca935fe9a.poster.avif?t=1757699608\" width=580 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817240/extras/1bd59b2a858d2e462645d53ca935fe9a.webm?t=1757699608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817240/extras/1bd59b2a858d2e462645d53ca935fe9a.mp4?t=1757699608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you dig deeper, you begin to question what's real and w\u0336\u0315\u034a\u0350\u030a\u0308\u0315\u0360\u030c\u0312\u0311\u0315\u031ch\u0335\u0360\u0314\u030f\u030b\u030f\u034a\u034a\u0333\u034d\u0330\u0347\u0329\u0321\u033c\u034d\u031c\u0332\u031c\u0327a\u0334\u0305\u035d\u035d\u030c\u0344\u0310\u0309\u030b\u030e\u0322\u0355\u0324\u0324\u034d\u035a\u0327\u0324\u035a\u0354\u0317t\u0338\u0300\u0333\u031e\u032c\u0354\u0356\u0326\u0320 \u0334\u0351\u0301\u0