d closed doors, a classified program known as the <strong><i>Heaven Project</i></strong> was launched.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sounds good, right? Then experience heaven firsthand in this game and see this terrible madness created by turquoise</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcfc STEP INTO THE VIDEOS - <i>Face fears that aren't yours</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817240/extras/cfa20e298c4d1ab754398e125bf71cf6.poster.avif?t=1757699608\" width=800 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817240/extras/cfa20e298c4d1ab754398e125bf71cf6.webm?t=1757699608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817240/extras/cfa20e298c4d1ab754398e125bf71cf6.mp4?t=1757699608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Selim Kara\u2019s final memories aren\u2019t just recorded, they\u2019re <strong>playable</strong>.<br> Each decrypted video becomes a first-person journey through his simulated <strong>heaven</strong>. <br> which quickly twists into something much darker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk through memory-made landscapes. <strong>Face fears that aren't yours</strong>.<br> And find out what truly went wrong in the <strong>Heaven Project.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f NOSTALGIA AS YOU WANT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817240/extras/fd10bf6dbf73d9e6ae9069a499b54609.poster.avif?t=1757699608\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817240/extras/fd10bf6dbf73d9e6ae9069a499b54609.webm?t=1757699608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817240/extras/fd10bf6dbf73d9e6ae9069a499b54609.mp4?t=1757699608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We didn\u2019t just simulate the past, we <i>rebuilt</i> it.<br> From early 2000s internet slang and web design to the sounds of CRT monitors and classic error tones, everything is lovingly crafted to capture a time that's gone... but not forgotten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not retro for the sake of style.<br> It's memory turned into atmosphere.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd27 FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udda5\ufe0f A fully interactive retro desktop interface (inspired by Windows 95 &amp; 98)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc2 No HUD, no tutorials, just you, your instincts, and the machine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcfc Six <strong>playable memory-videos</strong>, each unlocking deeper psychological layers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf10 Nostalgic 2000s internet: from forums to fake websites, reimagined with eerie accuracy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Psychological and analog horror drawn from generative AI anomalies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd70\ufe0f Carefully crafted <strong>nostalgic atmosphere</strong>,\u00a0not just visual, but emotional</p></li></ul>","developers":["Rise Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817240/df5fc57905ed3eed341585a39f7c3558ec561195/header.jpg?t=1757699608","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Legal Lines (for Heaven Does Not Respond):<br><br><strong>\u00a9 2025 Rise Studios</strong>. All rights reserved. \"Heaven Does Not Respond\" and the 